The '''Colony of the Second Revelation''' was a colony<ref name="Dark Droids 1" /> on [[Mechis III]]<ref name="The Book of Ajax" /> where the [[Second Revelation]],<ref name="Dark Droids 1" /> a group of [[Sentience|sentient]] [[droid]]s,<ref name="Uncover">{{SW|url=news/marvel-star-wars-september-2023-preview|text=Uncover the ''Dark Droids'' Crossover Event in Marvel's September 2023 ''Star Wars'' Comics – Exclusive Preview}}</ref> resided.<ref name="Dark Droids 1" /> While Second Revelation leader [[Ajax Sigma]] considered the colony and Mechis III one in the same,<ref name="The Book of Ajax" /> the colony was actually a location on the overall world.<ref name="Dark Droids 2">[[Dark Droids 2|''Dark Droids'' 2]]</ref>

